 "title": "Recorder - Otter Tail County, MN",
 "text": "Recorder - Otter Tail County, MN\nSkip to content\nEnglish Español Afsoomaali Hmong العربية Tiếng Việt Bosanski Norsk bokmål Svenska Deutsch Français\nEnglish\nMenu\nEvent Calendar\nContact\nPay\nApply or Register\nServices\nAssistance & Support\nBusiness & Workforce Development\nElections and Voting\nEnvironment & Natural Resources\nLicenses, Permits, Records & Inspections\nParks & Recreation\nProperty & Home\nPublic Safety & Law\nRecycling & Waste Disposal\nRoads & Transportation\nVisitors\nGovernment\nAbout Otter Tail County\nOur Long-Range Strategic Plan\nCities\nTownships\nLocations\nDepartments\nBoards & Commissions\nServe Your County\nPolicies & Ordinances (opens in new tab)\nProjects\nRequests for Data or Public Records\nSafety Data Sheets (opens in new tab)\nEmployment\nDepartments\nRecorder\nThe mission of the Recorder’s office is to provide professional customer service while accurately and efficiently recording real estate transfers, personal property documents & vital records.\nThe Otter Tail County Recorder & Registrar of Titles office is the custodian of all records of the County pertaining to personal property, real estate transfers and vital statistic records ( Birth , Death & Marriage ). They provide storage, access, retrieval and copies of these records for the public and businesses.\nOther documents recorded in our office include State and Federal Tax Liens, Veterans of Armed Services discharges, Notary Public registration and Ministerial credentials.\nOtter Tail County does not provide assistance in the completion of legal forms nor does the County assume liability for persons who attempt to complete legal documentation on their own. Once a document is recorded it is a permanent record and cannot be altered or removed by our office. A document can only be removed with a Court Order. Consulting with a legal representative to assist in land transfer documents and title searches is recommended.\nServices\nView all County Services related to this department\nResources\nProperty Fraud Alert\nLaredo Records Search (subscription required)\nTapestry Records Search (pay as you go)\nSearch for Documents by Location or Address using a Map\nSection Corner Locator\nContact\nFor general inquiries, please contact:\n218-998-8140 (opens in new tab)\nrecorder@ottertailcounty.gov (opens in new tab)\n565 W Fir Avenue\nFergus Falls, MN 56537\nDepartment Head\nLynn Larson\nCounty Recorder\nLocation(s)\nGovernment Services Center\n500 West Fir Avenue\nFergus Falls , Minnesota 56537\nView All County Locations\nBack to All Departments\nAccessibility\nAIS Public Access Locations\nAlerts\nApply or Register\nBoards & Commissions\nCommissioner Districts\nContact\nCounty Fee Schedule\nDaily Activity Report\nDemographics\nDepartments\nDitch Redetermination Presentation\nEligibility Worker Supplemental Rating Assessment\nEmergency Information Hub\nEmployment\nFinancial and Accounting Reports\nHealthy Together Newsletter Subscription\nHistory Continental Divide Monument | New York Mills\nCourthouse History\nCraigie Flour Mill\nLeaf City\nSheriff History\nThe Minnesota Woman\nHome\nLand & Resource Management Customer Satisfaction Survey\nMedia\nMy Subscriptions\nNew Residents\nNotification Center\nOpen Forum Request\nOTC 150\nOtter Tail County & Government About Otter Tail County\nOur Long-Range Strategic Plan\nPay For\nPrivacy Policy\nResources for Families\nSearch\nServe Your County Sheriff’s Posse\nSheriff Warrant List\nSubscription Message\nSupport Enforcement Aide Supplemental Rating Assessment\nTerms of Service\nThank You\nThank You-BOC\nThank You-Open Forum\nThank You!\nThank you! We will contact you.\nTownship Election Information\nVisitors\nOtter Tail County\nAbout Otter Tail County\nNews\nEvents\nMedia Inquiries\nContact\nPopular Links\nEmployment\nNotification Center\nProjects\nMaps & Data\nMortgage Foreclosure Sales (opens in new tab)\nPeople & Places\nBoard of Commissioners\nTownships\nCities\nLocations\nCommissioner